{
  "slug": "tigris-storage",
  "name": "Tigris Storage",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Tigris object storage integration — CLI reference for bucket management, object operations, access keys, IAM, and migrations. Skills cover authentication, CORS, presigned URLs, snapshots, forks, shadow bucket migrations, lifecycle rules, and notifications.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 agent**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `tigris-access-keys` (Use when creating, listing, assigning, or deleting access keys for Tigris Storage), `tigris-authentication` (Use when authenticating with Tigris, managing credentials, or setting up the CLI), `tigris-buckets` (Use when creating, configuring, or deleting Tigris buckets — includes regions, tiers, CORS, migrations, TTL, notifications, snapshots, and…), `tigris-iam` (Use when managing IAM policies, users, and permissions in a Tigris organization), `tigris-objects` (Use when uploading, downloading, listing, moving, deleting, or presigning objects in Tigris Storage)\n- **Agents** (1): `tigris-storage-agent` (Specialized agent for Tigris object storage — manages buckets, objects, migrations, IAM, and infrastructure via CLI)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tigris-storage@claude-community` from `tigrisdata/tigris-agents-plugins`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "agent": 1
  },
